{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49715","headline":"河传 三 · 孙光宪","name":"河传 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花落，烟薄，谢家池阁，寂寞春深。\n翠蛾轻敛意沈吟，沾襟，无人知此心。\n玉炉香断霜灰冷，帘铺影，梁燕归红杏。\n晚来天，空悄然，孤眠，枕檀云髻偏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙光宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49715.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49715","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}